assistant-ui
============

Project:   https://github.com/assistant-ui/assistant-ui
License:   MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AgentbaseAI Inc.
Taken at:  commit f92028b466cba721846de6851e4dddb6c04ecfad of the main branch (fetched 2026-11-10)
Obtained:  by hand from the registry the elements' Installation sections name
           (https://r.assistant-ui.com/image.json and
           https://r.assistant-ui.com/elements-image-gallery.json). The shadcn CLI does not fit this
           repository: it has no components.json, uses base-ui rather than Radix, and draws icons
           from @chopin/icons.

Elements adopted (the standalone lane only, driven by props; nothing of the runtime lane, no
AssistantRuntimeProvider, useAui or runtime primitives, and no dependency on the library):

  Image
    Source:  packages/ui/src/components/react/assistant-ui/elements/image.tsx
             (last changed in commit 3b6591b1)
    Here:    apps/web/src/chat/image.tsx, apps/web/src/chat/image.css
    Kept:    ImageRoot, ImagePreview (the loading, loaded and broken states, and the check of an image
             the browser already has), ImageActions with its copy and download, and the copy and
             download helpers.
    Changed: Chopin's tokens, icons and buttons in place of Tailwind's palette, lucide-react and
             class-variance-authority; a frame that holds the image's own shape while it loads; the
             alt text always shown; a Generated label; the editor's lightbox in place of the zoom
             overlay; copy writes PNG, the one type a browser lets a page copy; actions are offered
             only for an image that loaded. ImageFilename is ImageCaption.

  Image gallery
    Source:  packages/ui/src/components/react/assistant-ui/elements/image-gallery.tsx
             (last changed in commit 9121416f)
    Here:    apps/web/src/chat/image-gallery.tsx, apps/web/src/chat/image.css
    Kept:    the images, maxVisible and onOpen props, the grid of up to six tiles with +N on the last,
             and a lightbox that steps through every image by arrow key.
    Changed: each tile is the Chat image element; the lightbox is the editor's
             (packages/editor/src/widgets/image-lightbox.tsx), which also keeps the focus trap of the
             library's zoom overlay; a plain CSS container query in place of the library's Tailwind one.

  Helpers
    The library's href and range utilities (elements-href at commit 87e76e00, elements-range at
    commit 800494dc) are not copied. What Chopin needs of them, the clamp of the number of visible
    tiles and the check of an address before it is loaded, is written in
    apps/web/src/chat/image-state.ts.

